Zero point energy                ...      0.17277896 Eh     108.42 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00905399 Eh       5.68 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
